    {
      "source": "Entity callback method invoked before a domain object is saved. Can return either the same or a modified instance\nof the domain object and can modify <code>Document</code> contents. This method is called after converting the\n<code>entity</code> to <code>Document</code> so effectively the document is used as outcome of invoking this callback.",
      "translation": "在保存域对象之前调用实体回调方法。该方法可以返回相同的或修改后的域对象实例，并且可以修改 `<code>` 文档内容。此方法在将 `<code>` 实体转换为 `<code>` 文档之后被调用，因此实际上该文档被视为调用此回调的结果。",
      "count": 1
    },
